  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amigo hall room bookings for pre/post sessions for the CAFOD/Bond localisation conference 27/03/25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD, in partnership with Bond and the Universities of Warwick and Essex, organised a conference on localisation on March 27th in London, attended by senior donor/INGO/LNA representatives. As part of our planning, we rented a room in Amigo hall on the 26th to brief the speakers, and again on the 28th to agree with key attendees on follow up actions/recommendations from the conference.</narrative>
  </description>
